{"id":"5cc312c6e3fc50d2","group":"90","path":"90/90-ex-berry-paradox-formal.md","title":"Berry Paradox Formalization","display":"ex-berry-paradox-formal — Berry Paradox Formalization","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ex-berry-paradox-formal","aliases":["90-ex-berry-paradox-formal"],"display":"ex-berry-paradox-formal — Berry Paradox Formalization","depends_on":["[[90-df-berry-paradox]]","[[90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable]]","[[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded]]","[[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]","[[90-df-effective-procedure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ex-berry-paradox-formal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ex-berry-paradox-formal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-berry-paradox-formal — Berry Paradox Formalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"777baa75a4312c8e\" href=\"?note=777baa75a4312c8e\" title=\"90-df-berry-paradox\">90-df-berry-paradox</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8959cc2a17246321\" href=\"?note=8959cc2a17246321\" title=\"90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable\">90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f8fee89a8d4aa2f\" href=\"?note=1f8fee89a8d4aa2f\" title=\"90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded\">90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d83e22f672cfb25\" href=\"?note=7d83e22f672cfb25\" title=\"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity\">90-df-kolmogorov-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U\">\\(K_U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7d83e22f672cfb25\" href=\"?note=7d83e22f672cfb25\" title=\"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity\">90-df-kolmogorov-complexity</a>；无界性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1f8fee89a8d4aa2f\" href=\"?note=1f8fee89a8d4aa2f\" title=\"90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded\">90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Effective}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a>，字串采用恒等表示，自然数采用该文件固定的数值词表示。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s,t\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|w|\">\\(|w|\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_i\">\\(w_i\\)</span> 分别为有限字串的长度与坐标，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为字串连接。下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{sl}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{sl}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_m\">\\(\\ell_m\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span>，不将任一构造当作额外假设。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinRep}\">\\(\\mathrm{BinRep}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ns&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}t\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n(|s|&lt;|t|\\land\\forall j&lt;|s|\\ s_j=t_j)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists i&lt;\\min\\{|s|,|t|\\}\\ [(\\forall j&lt;i\\ s_j=t_j)\\land s_i=0\\land t_i=1],\\\\\ns&lt;_{\\mathrm{sl}}t&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |s|&lt;|t|\\lor(|s|=|t|\\land s&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}t),\\\\\nB(m,s)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ K_U(s)&gt;m\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (t&lt;_{\\mathrm{sl}}s\\Longrightarrow K_U(t)\\le m),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists!s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ B(m,s),\\\\\nb&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(m,s)\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}:B(m,s)\\},\\\\\nb&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ns&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}t\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n(|s|&lt;|t|\\land\\forall j&lt;|s|\\ s_j=t_j)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists i&lt;\\min\\{|s|,|t|\\}\\ [(\\forall j&lt;i\\ s_j=t_j)\\land s_i=0\\land t_i=1],\\\\\ns&lt;_{\\mathrm{sl}}t&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |s|&lt;|t|\\lor(|s|=|t|\\land s&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}t),\\\\\nB(m,s)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ K_U(s)&gt;m\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ (t&lt;_{\\mathrm{sl}}s\\Longrightarrow K_U(t)\\le m),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists!s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ B(m,s),\\\\\nb&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(m,s)\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}:B(m,s)\\},\\\\\nb&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BinRep}(m,s)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |s|&gt;0\\land s_0=1\n\\land m+1=\\sum_{i&lt;|s|}s_i2^{|s|-1-i},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists!s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{BinRep}(m,s),\\\\\nw&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(m,s)\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}:\\mathrm{BinRep}(m,s)\\},\\\\\nw&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\ell_m&amp;\\coloneqq|w(m)|,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}(m)&amp;\\coloneqq(1)_{i&lt;\\ell_m}\\,{}^\\frown(0)_{i&lt;1}\\,{}^\\frown w(m).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BinRep}(m,s)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |s|&gt;0\\land s_0=1\n\\land m+1=\\sum_{i&lt;|s|}s_i2^{|s|-1-i},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists!s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\mathrm{BinRep}(m,s),\\\\\nw&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(m,s)\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}:\\mathrm{BinRep}(m,s)\\},\\\\\nw&amp;:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\ell_m&amp;\\coloneqq|w(m)|,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}(m)&amp;\\coloneqq(1)_{i&lt;\\ell_m}\\,{}^\\frown(0)_{i&lt;1}\\,{}^\\frown w(m).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}(K_U)\\Longrightarrow\\exists c,m_0\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\ge m_0\\quad\nm&lt;K_U(b(m))\\le K_U(\\operatorname{bin}(m))+c&lt;m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Effective}(K_U)\\Longrightarrow\\exists c,m_0\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall m\\ge m_0\\quad\nm&lt;K_U(b(m))\\le K_U(\\operatorname{bin}(m))+c&lt;m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Effective}(K_U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Effective}(K_U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U\">\\(K_U\\)</span> 可计算，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的顺序搜索终止且有效。定义前缀机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>：在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 上先运行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(p)\">\\(U(p)\\)</span>，若输出为合法码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(m)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(m)\\)</span> 则输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(m)\">\\(b(m)\\)</span>，否则发散。其定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(U)\\)</span> 的子集，因而前缀自由。最优性给出固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U(b(m))\\le K_U(\\operatorname{bin}(m))+c\">\\(K_U(b(m))\\le K_U(\\operatorname{bin}(m))+c\\)</span>。再取只在合法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 码上输出自身的前缀机器，最优性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0\">\\(c_0\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U(\\operatorname{bin}(m))\\le2\\ell_m+1+c_0\">\\(K_U(\\operatorname{bin}(m))\\le2\\ell_m+1+c_0\\)</span>。选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_0\">\\(m_0\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\ell_m+1+c_0+c&lt;m\">\\(2\\ell_m+1+c_0+c&lt;m\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge m_0\">\\(m\\ge m_0\\)</span> 成立，即得所列矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原来以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 和编译常数形成的 Berry 矛盾链。原普通字典序的“第一个”未必存在，故改为有效良序 shortlex；常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 在蕴涵后件中存在量化，不再是未受构造约束的自由变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-berry-paradox","status":"resolved","id":"777baa75a4312c8e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnc